Do you want to know how fast does your car accelerate to 100 km/h?
It’s not a secret, that data of producer is approximate and apply only for ideal conditions. To know the current speed here and now, to make a measure 0-100 km/h, 100-200 km/h, time for ¼ miles ( time of passing 402 meters) will help you the application Test-Drive.
You don’t need any additional devices as RaceLogic, because you already have the accelerometer sensor and GPS sensor in your smartphone. Due to these super sensitive sensors of your iPhone and unique algorithm, we have got am opportunity to measure the time of acceleration of the car to the necessary speed with a high accuracy.
Opportunities of the application:
          - acceleration to 100 km/h;
          - acceleration from 100 to 200 km/h;
          - acceleration to 80 km/h;
          - acceleration from 80 to 120 km/h;
          - time of passing 402 meters and 1000 meters;
          - understandable interface;
          - constant updates and expansion of the functional;
          - the results of the measures save automatically and you can share them with your friends!

ASSISTANT FOR MMA FANS

Stats Fight app is also a great assistant for fans of UFC and other MMA promotions:
- Schedule and current cards of future UFC and MMA events;
- Complete information about future fighters: record, age, country, height, data on winning methods, etc.;
- Live scores and live statistics of UFC and MMA events;
- Unique Stats Fight Rating and detailed technical arsenal allows you to get additional detailed information before fights;
- Innovative solutions based on G-Fight data and the dynamics of the fight (Course of the fight) allow you to anticipate the fighter's victory during the broadcast;
- Unique assessment of the performance of fighters in a cage (Stats Fight Performance), showing the effectiveness of using the entire complex of the technical arsenal of a mixed martial arts fighter in a fight aimed at achieving victory.

MMA PICKS

Our app offers a fresh and exciting format for Picks UFC, PFL, Bellator, Rizin FF, LFA, MMA Series, and more. In Fantasy MMA, players can recruit fighters from the same event and compete with other players and with friends. The scoring system is based on the performance of a fighter in the octagon, with coins are awarded for such things as the method of victory, the advantage of the first strike, the advantage of thrown and landed strikes, takedowns, submissions and other statistical indicators.

COLLECTING CARDS

You can spend coins to buy fighter cards to assemble your virtual gym of the best fighters or to buy indicators cards to increase your chances of winning Picks MMA in the next event.

